// The action table (SPEC 7.1): one typed constant from which the CLI subcommands, the MCP tool
// list, the window API's describe().actions, the OpenAPI document, the palette entries and the
// skills' reference tables are generated by `pnpm generate:contracts`. Every entry is declared
// now, including the ones whose implementation lands later; the dispatcher answers
// not_implemented (HTTP 501) for those (MILESTONES M1 item 3). Every mutating action takes
// baseRevision and rejects a stale one with 409 and the current document.
